WEBVTT

00:01:27.708 --> 00:01:31.003
On the front lines
of actual construction sites,

00:01:31.045 --> 00:01:35.508
only four percent
of construction workers are female.

00:01:38.553 --> 00:01:40.763
(Drill whirrs)

00:01:51.440 --> 00:01:52.733
Four percent.

00:01:52.733 --> 00:01:54.944
Just one in 25.

00:01:54.944 --> 00:01:56.863
That's totally unacceptable.

00:01:57.947 --> 00:02:02.827
But it's also a huge opportunity,
both for women and for the trades.